<tr><td>5</td><td>new PriorityQueue(Collection c)</td><td>Natural order of elements</td><td>Builds heap from collection&#x27;s elements</td></tr>
<tr><td>6</td><td>new PriorityQueue(PriorityQueue c)</td><td>Same order as source</td><td>Copy constructor</td></tr>
